00:35:12.170 --> 00:35:14.030
We can prove it.

00:35:14.030 --> 00:35:18.740
In this case, this is what
the system Vision API labels

00:35:18.740 --> 00:35:20.390
against this exact image.

00:35:20.390 --> 00:35:21.320
We say it's a cat.

00:35:21.320 --> 00:35:24.600
It's a pet, which is interesting
