00:42:13.750 --> 00:42:14.680
You retrain.

00:42:14.680 --> 00:42:16.210
You operationalize.

00:42:16.210 --> 00:42:18.070
You do worse than
a spreadsheet most

00:42:18.070 --> 00:42:19.842
