00:42:19.842 --> 00:42:21.550
Later, you start
beating the spreadsheet.

00:42:21.550 --> 00:42:22.720
You drop the mic
and you go home.

00:42:22.720 --> 00:42:24.610
And then you start trying to
beat the simple models that

00:42:24.610 --> 00:42:26.440
used to be in place
six months ago when

00:42:26.440 --> 00:42:28.720
