Are these two layers.

00:44:06.820 --> 00:44:08.650
So things on the
data side, of course,

00:44:08.650 --> 00:44:10.919
are naturally related to
the machine learning side.

00:44:10.919 --> 00:44:12.460
We're getting a lot
of free attention

00:44:12.460 --> 00:44:13.930
in this room and other
rooms around machine

00:44:13.930 --> 00:44:15.305
learning because
it's new science

00:44:15.305 --> 00:44:18.340
and it's unicorns and glitter.

