00:45:35.830 --> 00:45:37.900
We've all had the
compiler day, right?

00:45:37.900 --> 00:45:39.940
Today's the day I'm going
to build some stuff.

00:45:39.940 --> 00:45:40.990
You compile.

00:45:40.990 --> 00:45:43.047
If it's non-trivial,
