00:50:42.420 --> 00:50:44.019
That's what we
are doing as well.

00:50:44.019 --> 00:50:45.560
So as we learn things
that TensorFlow

00:50:45.560 --> 00:50:47.600
needs or should have,
we write those things

00:50:47.600 --> 00:50:49.010
and contribute those things.

