00:50:51.140 --> 00:50:54.380
And the middle section,
it's Cloud ML Engine.

00:50:54.380 --> 00:50:55.850
We went through a rename.

00:50:55.850 --> 00:50:59.720
This basically automates the
sucky bits of TensorFlow.

00:50:59.720 --> 00:51:02.210
I need 64 GPUs.

00:51:02.210 --> 00:51:03.770
